OL,3,GNEWSAStudents say they feel unsafe in  
OL,4,A'poorly lit' streets                   
OL,6,FOn any given night, York is busy with  
OL,7,Fstudents enjoying its bars, pubs and   
OL,8,Fnightclubs.                            
OL,10,FDespite official government figures    
OL,11,Fstating that York is one of the safest 
OL,12,Fcities in the country, its historic    
OL,13,Fcentre has many poorly lit and narrow  
OL,14,Fstreets.                               
OL,16,FYoung women studying at York's         
OL,17,Funiversities say that the lack of      
OL,18,Flighting in certain areas leaves them  
OL,19,Ffeeling unsafe walking home.           
